OL,3,AThe AI start-ups fixing India's broken
OL,4,Aroads and messy land records
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2020, Sanjay Mandava flew down from
OL,7,FChicago to Chennai in southern India to
OL,8,Fresolve a personal land dispute.
OL,10,FOver the next few months, he was
OL,11,Frunning around between government
OL,12,Foffices to access a dozen records that
OL,13,Fwould conclusively prove that the
OL,14,Fproperty belonged to his family.
OL,16,FJust a sale deed dating back to when
OL,17,Fhis parents bought the land was not
OL,18,Fenough. Authorities asked him to
OL,19,Fproduce a string of other documents.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
